---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,theme(colors.teal.500/0.18),transparent_55%),radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_left,theme(colors.indigo.500/0.18),transparent_55%)]"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-24 md:pt-32 md:pb-32">
    <p class="animate-fade-up text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 mb-6">Product · Engineering · Go-to-market</p>
    <h1 class="animate-fade-up delay-1 text-5xl md:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 leading-[1.05] max-w-4xl">
      Hey, I'm Joachim.<br />
      <span class="text-neutral-500">I build and scale products.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="animate-fade-up delay-2 mt-8 text-lg text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      Engineer by training, product by practice. 8+ years across startups and Fortune 500 companies —
      ExxonMobil, Continental, Outer Labs, Publicis Sapient — shipping products in automotive, energy,
      e-commerce, and enterprise analytics.
    </p>
    <div class="animate-fade-up delay-3 mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-neutral-900 font-medium hover:bg-neutral-200 transition"
      >
        Let's work together
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#work"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-900 px-6 py-3 text-neutral-100 font-medium border border-neutral-800 hover:border-neutral-700 transition"
      >
        See my work
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
